  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Development Fund 13 Replenishment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the UK&#x2019;s contribution to the 12th replenishment of the Asian Development Bank&#x2019;s Asian Development Fund (ADF), creating ADF13. The ADF provides grants to the poorest and most vulnerable countries in Asia and the Pacific to help them achieve the Sustainable Development Goals. In particular, financing is used to improve prosperity, strengthen health care, and help countries to both reduce and adapt to climate change by replacing fossil fuels with renewable energy and ensure infrastructure is designed and built to withstand future climate changes.</narrative>
  </description>
